x27;s Temperature API and hyperlocal temperature intelligence.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-6"><a href="https://www.fortyguard.com/hackathon-registration" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-[clamp(0.9375rem,0.9rem_+_0.2vw,1.0625rem)] font-semibold text-white no-underline transition-colors duration-150" style="background-color:#1769b0;padding:0.75rem 1.5rem">Register Now<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="margin-left:0.4em"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m13 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a><div class="relative"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg text-[clamp(0.9375rem,0.9rem_+_0.2vw,1.0625rem)] font-semibold text-white cursor-pointer transition-colors duration-150" style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);padding:0.75rem 1.5rem">Invite Participants<svg width="0.85em" height="0.85em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="transform:none;transition:transform 150ms"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-1" style="color:#93a3b8;font-size:clamp(0.8125rem, 0.78rem + 0.15vw, 0.875rem)"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color:#ffda00">•</span>Free to participate</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color:#ffda00">•</span>$6,000 in prizes</span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color:#ffda00">•</span>Powered by Temperature API</span></div></div><div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/691da9e6bd8f16de7829f4b9/6a50f4fabbef84b6c1a912fd_Icon.png" alt="Hackathon visual" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto"/></div></div></div></section><section style="background-color:#f8fafc;font-family:&#x27;Switzer Variable&#x27;, sans-serif"><div style="max-width:75rem;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 6rem) clamp(1.25rem, 0.5rem + 3vw, 2.5rem)"><div class="grid mb-10" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(20rem, 100%), 1fr));gap:clamp(1.5rem, 1rem + 2vw, 3rem)"><div><p class="m-0 mb-3 font-bold uppercase" style="color:#1769b0;font-size:clamp(0.75rem, 0.7rem + 0.2vw, 0.8125rem);letter-spacing:0.08em">About the Hackathon</p><h2 class="font-extrabold m-0" style="color:#15181f;font-size:clamp(1.625rem, 1.3rem + 1.6vw, 2.25rem);line-height:1.2">Build AI That Creates Real-World Impact</h2></div><div style="color:#5c6470;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.7"><p class="m-0 mb-4">Building the World’s Temperature AI is a global virtual AI hackathon designed to inspire the next generation of climate technology.</p><p class="m-0">Using FortyGuard&#x27;s NVIDIA-recognized Temperature API, participants gain access to hyperlocal urban temperature intelligence measured 2 meters above the ground, enabling them to create practical AI solutions for cities, infrastructure, energy, and public safety. Whether you&#x27;re an experienced AI engineer or a student building your first project, this is your opportunity to solve real-world challenges with real data.</p></div></div><div class="grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(11rem, 100%), 1fr));gap:clamp(1rem, 0.8rem + 0.8vw, 1.5rem)"><div class="rounded-2xl" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e9e9ec;padding:clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1vw, 1.75rem)"><p class="m-0 mb-1 font-extrabold" style="color:#1769b0;font-size:clamp(1.375rem, 1.2rem + 0.8vw, 1.75rem)">$6,000</p><p class="m-0" style="color:#5c6470;font-size:0.9375rem">Total Prize Pool</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl" style="background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e9e9ec;padding:clamp(1.25rem, 1rem + 1vw, 1.75rem)"><p class="m-0 mb-